  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Hand Hints 3D plays animated 3D hands that show how to perform hand gestures: pinch, tap, palm grab, two-handed scaling and the system tap on the glasses.
    
    Each example loops one gesture (or a short sequence) in front of you. Use Previous and Next on the panel below to switch gestures.
    
    The fingertips light up while a hand pinches, and the far pinch also shows the cursor it targets.
